{"completed": true, "response": "{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S03、S06、S11等段的感受提示偏密，连续出现时容易占用听音乐的注意力，个别词句也替观众把情绪解释得过于充分，留白不如Y。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X通过关键句加亮、话语与感受交替、感受按音乐时点出现，让观众更容易先抓住叙事主线，再在音乐推进中接收到细节，不必同时处理一大堆并列短词。它也更清楚地呈现了人物从离开后的失落、对亲近的怀念、对孤独的恐惧，到不愿为了陪伴重新忍受委屈、最终带着想念继续生活的心理变化；音乐感受则有力度、节奏、动作、音型和情绪转折的具体层次，不只是笼统地标注悲伤或激昂。\"\n}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "09c705e3-669d-443e-894b-5128a4b6b6e6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T011655483751Z", "elapsed_seconds": 63.625, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:17:59.120855+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "12f98bca59efa66752ca72ac06c1ee5e6cebcc6bd3fee63459aab46068f998da", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachmen